:: R1_Morning2 [r1 story]
<<set $time = { day: "tuesday", period: "morning", week: 1 }>>
<<location "Bedroom">>

Tuesday. The alarm. The count. The swing. The feet on the floor.

Lena is already gone this time. Yoga at 5:30, the morning class she started three months ago. Her side of the bed is cold. She left a note on the kitchen counter: "Greek yogurt's expired, can you grab some? xo L"

The "xo" is habit, not affection. I know this. I grab the note, fold it, place it in the recycling. The small domesticities of a marriage on autopilot.

Same shower. Same shave. Same shirt. Same tie. Same shoes. Same four pockets, four objects.

The drive is twenty-six minutes today. I don't listen to the podcast. I drive in silence and think about nothing, which takes more effort than it should.

